os, chasing revenge against the villain Handsome Jack. Each class has its own skills, and the Gunzerker can wield two guns at once.\n\nThe game can be played alone or in four-player co-op, and it has full controller support. It has a comedic, irreverent tone and a loot-driven cycle of fighting, collecting and upgrading. It suits players who enjoy shoot-and-loot games and want to team up with friends."}}